      {
        "name": "places/ChIJRUJAdfEABDQRa4dI1Ee26lI/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSejlyaVNBEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "☕️ Blooms Coffee 🌳\n\n@bloomsroastery founded by artist @moses_chan_ searches high-quality coffee beans has extended to brick-and-mortar @bloomscoffee with multiple locations 💫 all stores have a minimalistic, stylish, and aesthetic design with white and gold-tone 🕊 other than specialty coffee, coffee drip bags, coffee beans, and tea leaves are also available to make quality coffee at home 🍃 although it has opened for a few years, it was a full house with a long line up ☕️\n\n由陳豪建立自家咖啡品牌 @bloomsroastery 搜羅世界各地優質咖啡 延伸嘅實體店 @bloomscoffee 💫 已經總共有五間\n店舖用白金做色調 設計簡潔 型格清雅 🕊\n除咗精品咖啡 仲可以買咖啡掛耳包 咖啡豆 茶葉 🍃\n雖然已經開咗幾年 但坐滿晒人 仲好多人排隊 ☕️\n\n🔥 marshmallow latte HKD$60.00\n棉花糖係上面嗰層cream 🍦用個唧袋唧係咖啡上面\n用火槍將棉花糖燒到焦糖色 🔥 睇住整好吸引\n火炙棉花糖好挺身 外面硬硬地 帶點脆\n裏面軟綿綿 ☁️ 黏黏地 甜甜地 🍬\n配埋latte 嘅甘香同奶味 ☕️ 好夾 ✨️\n香甜綿滑 有回甘 唔膩也唔太甜\n\n☕️ cappuccino 12oz HKD$48.00\n可以揀 fruity or nutty 🌰 揀咗nutty 同 skim milk\n咖啡香濃 有堅果香 奶泡細滑綿密",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "☕️ Blooms Coffee 🌳\n\n@bloomsroastery founded by artist @moses_chan_ searches high-quality coffee beans has extended to brick-and-mortar @bloomscoffee with multiple locations 💫 all stores have a minimalistic, stylish, and aesthetic design with white and gold-tone 🕊 other than specialty coffee, coffee drip bags, coffee beans, and tea leaves are also available to make quality coffee at home 🍃 although it has opened for a few years, it was a full house with a long line up ☕️\n\n由陳豪建立自家咖啡品牌 @bloomsroastery 搜羅世界各地優質咖啡 延伸嘅實體店 @bloomscoffee 💫 已經總共有五間\n店舖用白金做色調 設計簡潔 型格清雅 🕊\n除咗精品咖啡 仲可以買咖啡掛耳包 咖啡豆 茶葉 🍃\n雖然已經開咗幾年 但坐滿晒人 仲好多人排隊 ☕️\n\n🔥 marshmallow latte HKD$60.00\n棉花糖係上面嗰層cream 🍦用個唧袋唧係咖啡上面\n用火槍將棉花糖燒到焦糖色 🔥 睇住整好吸引\n火炙棉花糖好挺身 外面硬硬地 帶點脆\n裏面軟綿綿 ☁️ 黏黏地 甜甜地 🍬\n配埋latte 嘅甘香同奶味 ☕️ 好夾 ✨️\n香甜綿滑 有回甘 唔膩也唔太甜\n\n☕️ cappuccino 12oz HKD$48.00\n可以揀 fruity or nutty 🌰 揀咗nutty 同 skim milk\n咖啡香濃 有堅果香 奶泡細滑綿密",
